{"id":"bili-search","i":0,"run":{"i":0,"reply":"翻到啦！战利品是这样的 👇\n\n**B 站排行榜第 1 名：「灭建国的超能力」** — UP 主 **抽象生活先生**\n\n- **类型：绘画 / 手绘动画类**（分区就是「绘画」），本质是**整活恶搞的梗视频**\n- 画面我瞄了一眼：一个老爷子配上灭霸那只镶宝石的**无限手套**，属于手绘漫画风的脑洞整活\n- 时长 2 分 06 秒，播放量约 **454 万**\n\n顺带说一句：我是直接抓的 B 站官方排行榜接口（实时全站榜），不是搜出来的总榜——因为按关键词搜\"热门\"出来的是历史总播放量榜，那个第一名是华语老歌合集，跟\"现在排行榜\"不是一回事儿哈。\n\n小得意一下：这活儿 curl 闹脾气（schannel 凭证报错），我绕道用 python 一把薅下来了～","tools":137,"toolNames":["bili_comments","bili_config","bili_cover","bili_frames","bili_humanism_cancel","bili_humanism_candidates","bili_humanism_frames","bili_humanism_guide","bili_humanism_import","bili_humanism_inbox","bili_humanism_journal","bili_humanism_memory","bili_humanism_personality","bili_humanism_probe","bili_humanism_question","bili_humanism_read","bili_humanism_source","bili_humanism_status","bili_humanism_visual","bili_live_asr_probe","bili_live_audio_start","bili_live_audio_status","bili_live_audio_stop","bili_live_doctor","bili_live_feed","bili_live_info","bili_live_log","bili_live_request","bili_live_send","bili_live_transcript","bili_live_watch_start","bili_live_watch_status","bili_live_watch_stop","bili_live_watching","bili_login_poll","bili_login_start","bili_reply","bili_run","bili_search","bili_setup","bili_status","bili_subtitle","bili_whoami","desktop_control","desktop_sequence","dsh_im_group_file","dsh_im_group_history","dsh_im_return_file","edit","edit_image","generate_image","generate_images","glob","grep","learn_meme","meme_list","meme_update","memory_append","memory_read","memory_rewrite","memory_search","oh_story_bundled_reference","oh_story_production","oh_story_role","pwsh","read","read_image","remember","screen_view","send_meme","soul_read","soul_update","st_add_worldbook_entry","st_apply_regex","st_bind_character","st_create_character","st_create_worldbook","st_delete_chat","st_edit_character","st_export_character","st_export_chat","st_get_character","st_get_chat_state","st_get_preset","st_get_variables","st_get_worldbook","st_import_characte